# Husky hook directory — regenerated on `pnpm install` by the
# `prepare` script (husky CLI + scripts/install-husky-hooks.cjs).
# Canonical hook bodies live in scripts/husky/ under version control.
.husky/

# Per-session Claude Code state: `settings.local.json` is personal and
# `.claude/worktrees/` holds git worktrees (architectural standard A8), so this
# directory is tooling, never source. Untracked it shows as a permanent pending
# change in every `git status` — and it is not merely cosmetic: a dirty repo
# aborts the whole `bump-factory-consumers.sh` fan-out at preflight.
.claude
